+# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
+# SPDX-FileCopyrightText: Copyright contributors to the vLLM project
+"""DFly2 speculator: KV-free, prefill-free block-parallel drafting + sequential correction.
+
+DFly2 shares the target model\x27s SWA and compressed-MLA KV caches and its selected
+DSA ``topk_indices`` across 3 parallel draft layers, then refines positions
+``1 .. num_speculative_tokens`` left-to-right through ``DFly2HiddenCorrection``
+and ``DFly2AttentiveCorrection``, sampling via the target\x27s shared ``lm_head``.
+
+Full-step CUDA graphs capture the entire draft forward (backbone + sequential
+correction + vocab-parallel sampling + confidence calibration) at exact
+``[1 .. max_num_seqs] * block_size`` shapes with zero batch-padding waste.
+"""
+
